---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<article class="post">
  <header class="post-header shell">
    <a class="eyebrow back-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">← 回到文章列表</a>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="post-lead">{{ description }}</p>
    <div class="post-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ date | htmlDateString }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>{{ readingTime }} 分鐘閱讀</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="post-grid shell">
    <aside class="post-aside" aria-label="文章資訊">
      <span class="aside-label">Filed under</span>
      <ul class="tag-list">
        {% for tag in tags %}
          {% if tag != "post" %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <span class="issue-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    </aside>

    <div class="prose">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="post-cta shell" aria-labelledby="post-cta-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Next note</p>
    <h2 id="post-cta-title">下一篇，從你的問題開始。</h2>
    <p>複製文章範本、換上自己的標題與內容，推送後就會自動發布。</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/{{ site.repository }}/tree/main/src/posts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      查看文章原始檔 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</article>

